  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个由 Serilum 制作的模组。充满爱心打造。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Simple Menu 提供了另一种选择，可作为其他功能繁多的主菜单编辑器的替代品。由于我的 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Vanilla Experience</a> 整合包需要一些基础功能，且希望能在每次 Minecraft 更新后快速发布，因此开发了此模组。不过它支持高度自定义，可能也正好符合您的需求。本模组刻意保持了简洁。如果您需要更强大的控制能力，我建议使用 FancyMenu。<br><br><strong>主要功能：</strong><br>&nbsp;&bull; 设置自定义窗口标题和图标。<br>&nbsp;&bull; 替换主菜单上的 Minecraft 标志。<br>&nbsp;&bull; 设置自定义背景。<br>&nbsp;&bull; 隐藏 Minecraft Realms 按钮。<br>&nbsp;&bull; 创建带有可点击链接的服务器主机推广按钮。<br>&nbsp;&bull; 隐藏标志旁边的随机标语文字。<br>&nbsp;&bull; 移除模组加载器显示的实验性警告文字。<br>&nbsp;&bull; 移除左下角的文字。<br></span><br><br></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/simple-menu/a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含于 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/customization-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum&#x27;s Customization Bundle\" width=\"416\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/client.svg\" alt=\"环境：客户端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>setCustomWindowTitle</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否设置自定义窗口标题。使用 'customWindowTitle' 中设置的值。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>customWindowTitle</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default \"Custom Window Title\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用 'setCustomWindowTitle' 时使用的自定义窗口标题。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>setCustomWindowIcon</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否设置自定义窗口图标。需要两个文件，均为 PNG 格式。一个是 16 像素正方形 'icon_16x16.png'，另一个是 32 像素正方形 'icon_32x32.png'。位于 './config/simplemenu/icon'。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>replaceMainMenuLogo</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否渲染自定义主菜单标志。这将替换 'Minecraft' 文字。需要一个 'logo.png' 文件。位于 './config/simplemenu/logo'。默认图像尺寸为 1024x256。若要完全移除，请使用空的 .png 文件。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>replaceMainMenuEditionLogo</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否渲染自定义主菜单“版本”标志。这将替换 'Java Edition' 文字。需要一个 'edition.png' 文件。位于 './config/simplemenu/logo'。默认图像尺寸为 512x64。若要完全移除，请使用空的 .png 文件。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>setCustomBackground</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否渲染自定义背景。需要一个 'background.png' 文件。位于 './config/simplemenu/background/'。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>hideMinecraftRealmsButton</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在主菜单上隐藏 Minecraft Realms 按钮。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>expandModsButton</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否将“模组”按钮的宽度扩展至与“单人游戏”按钮相同。在禁用 'hideMinecraftRealmsButton' 时可能有用。仅适用于 Forge 和 NeoForge。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableServerPromoButton</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否用服务器主机推广按钮替换 Minecraft Realms 按钮。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>serverPromoButtonTextDefault</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default \"Need a Server?\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">服务器推广按钮的默认文本。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>serverPromoButtonTextOnHover</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default \"Use code PROMO for 25% off\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">鼠标悬停在服务器推广按钮上时显示的文本。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>serverPromoButtonClickURL</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default \"https://localhost/exampleurl\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">点击服务器推广按钮时跳转的 URL。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>hideSplashText</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在主菜单上隐藏随机标语文字。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>removeExperimentalModLoaderText</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否移除主菜单上模组加载器的实验性/测试版文字。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>removeTextBottomLeft</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否移除主菜单左下角的文字。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/description.svg\" alt=\"说明\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>补充说明：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">上图中的“The Vanilla Experience”标志是使用 BlockBench 配合以下插件制作的：</span><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fewanhowell.com%252fplugins%252fminecraft-title-generator%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://ewanhowell.com/plugins/minecraft-title-generator/</a></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以自由在任何整合包中使用此模组，只要下载源仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态内即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由于无法在如此多的独立模组页面中统一管理评论，评论区已关闭。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他反馈，请访问&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
